  "description": "The Roadmachine THREE brings the essence of endurance performance to more riders. Its lightweight BMC Advanced Carbon frame is engineered to be compliant when the road is rough, responsive when precision matters, and effortlessly capable over long days. Every detail – from integrated cables to downtube storage and a rear light – ensures you and your carbon road bike are ready for unpredictable conditions.\nDelivering the signature Roadmachine ride quality with a more attainable specification, this model of the do-it-all road bike brings the ride quality, feel and confidence you expect from BMC in a package accessible to more riders.\nA complete Shimano 105 groupset takes care of shifting and braking, keeping its performance as dependable as this bike’s handling. PRD23 wheels provide a reliable, responsive ride, while wide, fast-rolling tires smoothen out rough roads and keep momentum high on ribbon-like tarmac. Paired with our integrated RSM01 stem and Endurance Alloy handlebars, you get world-class ergonomics that balance control, comfort and confidence on every ride.\nFor a do-it-all endurance road bike, there is only Roadmachine.",
